        "hypothesis": "ARM64 NEON odd-even sorting phases expose independent adjacent comparisons to SIMD, potentially reducing sorting time without reassociating floating-point reductions.",
        "id": "d2e54b2385594cc7",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
