          "retained": [
            "Fuse arithmetic and harmonic traversals, retaining each sum's original row order; then sort and calculate the median within the same independent column task.",
            "Use one statically scheduled OpenMP region with at most four workers, capped by available threads and columns. Bypass team creation below the dimension-based work threshold.",
            "Keep mode calls serial and ordered. Afterwards fuse sorted-column variance, standard deviation and coefficient calculations, retaining the original pow expression and accumulation order.",
            "Preserve input parsing, output formatting and existing helper functions."
          ]
        },
